Version: 0.2
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: ubuntu-thinksmart <noreply@localhost>
Depends: libc6, libstdc++6, libgnutls30t64, libudev1, libyaml-0-2, libegl1, libgles2, libgstreamer1.0-0, libgstreamer-plugins-base1.0-0, pipewire, wireplumber, libevent-core-2.1-7t64, libevent-pthreads-2.1-7t64
Conflicts: pipewire-libcamera, gstreamer1.0-libcamera
Replaces: pipewire-libcamera, gstreamer1.0-libcamera
Section: video
Priority: optional
Description: Front camera support for the Lenovo ThinkSmart View CD-18781Y
 S5KC505A sensor driver (kernel 6.19.5-msm8953), libcamera 0.8 with the
 S5KC505A sensor helper and LSC-aware GPU SoftISP patches (PR #6), installed
 in /opt/libcamera, plus the PipeWire libcamera SPA plugin and the GStreamer
 libcamerasrc element built against it.
